{"ref":"BDB, גָּדֵל","hw":"גָּדֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גָּדֵל</span></big>  <strong>pt.m.</strong> or <strong>adj.verbal. becoming great, growing up</strong>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:13\" href=\"/Genesis.26.13\">Gn 26:13</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:26\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.26\">1 S 2:26</a> (cf. Dr) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.12\">2 Ch 17:12</a>; also <strong>great</strong>, pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּדְלֵי בָשָׂר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.26\">Ez 16:26</a> <em>great of flesh</em>.","next":"BDB, גֹּ֫דֶל","prev":"BDB, גָּדַל"}